# Exa API keys for web-search-proxy rotation. Comma-separated list.
# Each account's key gets ~$10 of API credits per month; on exhaustion (HTTP 402)
# the proxy rotates to the next key and probes hourly until the refill lands.
# Copy to ~/.config/web-search-proxy/env and chmod 600:
#   EXA_API_KEYS=key1,key2,key3
